WEBVTT

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:15.320
Wake up, Futaba.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.660
Morning, Misato-kun.

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.170
<i>Misato-kun moved into the dorm 
and is rooming with me.</i>

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.600
<b>Truck Dad</b>

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.600
<b>Battles Without 
Morals 
and Humanity</b>

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.620
It's a fight! A fight...!

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Watari-senpai's now rooming
 with Onagawa-senpai.</i>

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:50.190
<i>Misato-kun is so meticulous 
and precise with his time.</i>

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:56.070
<i>I feel like the dorm 
has really come together.</i>

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:32.000
<b><i>Backflip!!</i></b>

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:36.960
It's just three weeks until 
the Tohoku Regional Tournament.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.500
You took second in prefecturals,

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.180
but are you ready to take first?

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.120
First?!

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:43.880
Yes!

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:44.930
Yeah!

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:44.930
Yah!

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:46.770
That's beyond us at the moment.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.440
Correct.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:53.070
So I was thinking of changing 
our current choreography.

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.320
Our choreography?

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:58.140
Raising the difficulty for a higher score?

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:01.410
Of course, that's going to make 
your practices that much tougher.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.490
Bring it on!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:06.200
But I want a little more time 
to think about it.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.120
I am planning on changing up our routine,

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.200
but for today, 
we'll stick to our usual practice.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.190
Sir!

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:13.930
Guys, let's get soaring!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.040
Yeah!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.040
Yah!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.870
I wonder what the new choreography will be!

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.790
Manly and powerful, I'll bet!

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:53.720
Perhaps he could incorporate the striking 
whiteness and mellow flavor of sasakama.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:56.210
Manly sasakama! I like it!

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:57.730
Same! Let's go tell the coach.

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:58.670
Let's not.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.470
I'mma stop by the convenience store. Later.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.720
Sure. Great practice today!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:03.490
Yah!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:03.490
See you tomorrow!

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:05.160
Hey, shut the door!

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.470
<b>T
A
K
O
Y
A
K
I</b>

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.470
<b>TSURUYA</b>

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:17.610
<b><i>Thick Sliced</i></b>

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.610
<b><i>Ace</i></b>

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.110
<b><i>Ace</i></b>

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.250
Ace.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.360
Ace... Ace...

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:34.120
Onagawa...

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.540
Are you all right?

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:41.750
I heard you were hit by a moped.

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:43.920
A-Actually, I dodged it...

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.080
It just got a little twisted up in the process.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.170
I spent last night at home.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:50.230
You went to the hospital, right?

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:53.760
Yeah, and... they said...

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.810
two weeks to recover?

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:56.750
Two weeks?

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.240
Or, er, maybe three...

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.260
That takes us right up to regionals.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.360
Does that mean we might not 
be able to perform with six?!

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.080
What should we do, Coach?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.660
We'll have to wait and see.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.970
Onagawa-kun, you'll be watching
practice until your ankle's better.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:18.540
R-Right...

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.720
When you're injured, 
it's important to rest up.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.730
My wife says that, too.

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:27.800
Listen, Onagawa-kun.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:32.470
I want you better. <i>All</i> better.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.590
If anything else about you is ailing,

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.830
I want that better, too.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.920
In <i>all</i> ways, you hear me?

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:44.440
R-Right...

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:46.560
Ow, ow, ow...

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:49.310
How you likin' the ride?

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.620
You mean besides the utter humiliation?

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:55.130
Better than the alternative, right?

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:57.780
Yer real important to us, Onagawa-senpai!

00:05:57.780 --> 00:06:00.250
Yeah! Do your best to get better.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:04.260
Okay, man, take care of him.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.210
Yah!

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.220
Here.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.600
I'll get you some water!

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:13.050
Which chopsticks are yours again, Onagawa?

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:15.020
Please! I can get them myself—

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.180
Don't you dare!

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.290
You gotta take care! Take care of yerself!

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.440
Watari, you're scaring me!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.820
Okay! Time to eat.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:23.720
Your water.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:25.080
Here. Your chopsticks.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.110
I can feed you if you'd like.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.640
Are you kidding me?! 
I can eat my own damn food!

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:33.030
You're a bunch of mother hens!

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:36.160
Get a freaking grip!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:50.720
I wonder...

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:52.930
Let's do it, Misato-kun!

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.330
We're hitting the bath now.

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.920
Hey, Captain!

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:01.940
Misato-kun and I will look after
 Onagawa-senpai for a while.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.360
We'd appreciate that, but...

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.360
You sure, man?

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.040
Yes! We'll go tell him right now.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.440
Come on, Misato-kun!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:10.980
Pardon us!

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.660
Hey, hang on...

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:14.190
Futaba!

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:23.790
Huh? Maybe he's not in...

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:25.860
Stand up straight!

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:34.240
<i>I've kept my feet moving fast</i>

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:31.050
Excuse us...

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:35.840
<i>My dream</i>

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:38.460
<i>Kiss!</i>

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:45.040
<i>Happy dance!</i>

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:56.580
You saw, didn't you?

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:57.800
Yes.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.810
Um, Senpai, your foot...

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:02.460
Are you faking?

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.460
Please, don't tell the others!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.410
What?!

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:09.450
I just need time to think without 
the distraction of practice for a while!

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.970
Please! I'm begging you!

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:15.040
Think? About what?

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.390
Misato-kun?

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.770
All right.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:25.110
Huh?

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:26.060
Really?!

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.550
But until you work things out,

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:31.050
you'd better keep the act up 24/7.

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:33.900
Don't drop it for a second, 
even when you're alone.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.950
Are you serious, Misato-kun?

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.410
You and I aren't practiced liars.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:43.040
Do I make myself clear, Onagawa-senpai?

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.420
Y-Yeah...

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:49.310
Huh? You're moving into Onagawa's room?

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:52.540
Yes, I'll stay and look after him.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:54.500
I'm sure that's not necessary...

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:58.350
Misato!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:02.610
I'm trustin' you... I'm entrustin' you 
with Bro Onagawa's life!

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.560
Er, he's not exactly in mortal danger...

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.400
Watari-senpai, you're hurting my neck.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.570
Huh? Does this mean...

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:16.240
<i>What was I thinking...? What's wrong with me?</i>

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:19.370
<b>Nightlife in Higashi-Koganei Chapter</b>

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:19.370
<b>Battlefield of Honor</b>

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.800
Bro!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.150
Don't die, Bro!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:26.140
Bro!

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:27.000
Yeah, this checks out...

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.170
Wow, you folded mine, too?

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.360
Thanks a ton!

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:34.010
Could you please keep 
your weight off that foot?

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:37.380
And you sorted these by release? 
You researched all that?

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.670
It bothers me when things
 aren't done properly.

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.360
We got ourselves a Meticulous Ace, huh?

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:43.270
Don't call me that.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.600
Is it all merchandise related to her?

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.440
Yeah. Cute, isn't she?

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:50.070
Masami Kudo, or Ma-chan!

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:51.750
She's not the ace of the group,

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:54.190
but she might rank second 
or third in overall popularity.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:55.550
Is that so?

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:58.950
But she's always optimistic, 
aiming to do better.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:02.150
Just watching her energizes me!

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:04.020
Mad respect, girl!

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:05.360
Hey, I've got a Blu-ray—

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:06.650
Please no.

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:09.580
C'mon, show some interest!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.840
What are you writing, anyway?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.840
Issues I discovered during the day's practice.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:16.860
You do this every day?

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:17.840
Yes.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.000
I see...

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:22.970
What is it?

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.800
I'm not sure this is gonna work.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:26.790
What?!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:28.640
Can I room with Shotaro instead?

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.700
No.

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:32.480
Futaba will just do whatever you tell him.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:35.250
I want Shotaro! Wah! Wah!

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:39.210
Gimme Shotaro! I want Shotaro!

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:40.830
Mind your foot! Get a grip already!

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:41.990
Shotaro!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.550
Senpai, your foot.

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:54.500
I told you not to let your guard down.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.060
R-Right...

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:57.940
Well, we'll be back later.

00:10:57.940 --> 00:10:59.740
Take it easy, okay?

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:00.800
See ya.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:03.040
Yeah. Later, dudes.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:08.190
Your foot.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.580
I'm exhausted...

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:26.500
Your foot.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.520
Wh-Where'd you guys come from?

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.580
What are you, Ninja Ace and Spy Leaf?

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.630
Don't call me that.

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:35.710
I'm not a fan of "Spy Leaf," either.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.850
Misato-kun wanted to check on you.

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:42.050
B-But there isn't even anyone around...

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.940
Don't let your guard down.

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:56.720
Onagawa-kun.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:59.110
How are you feeling?

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:01.760
Get yourself better soon, okay?

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:04.130
In <i>all</i> ways, you hear me?

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.300
Y-Yeah...

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.370
It really is a shame.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:12.200
Your tumbling was always so beautiful.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:16.260
And you're the most 
flexible guy on the team.

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.890
Goodness, what a pity indeed...

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.600
You think he knows?

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.600
Huh? Did you say something?

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.980
N-No, nothing!

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:35.040
A-Are you okay, Onagawa-senpai?!

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:40.580
I'm suffocating here.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.740
I wonder what Onagawa-senpai's 
thinking about.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.280
What should we do?

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:51.370
What if we can't perform as a full team?

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:55.790
Either way, it's too late to tell 
the coach and the others.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.380
I know, but...

00:12:58.280 --> 00:12:59.940
I've been wondering...

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:04.430
When he asked us to keep it a secret, 
why did you agree?

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.770
That just doesn't seem like you.

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:09.930
All we can do is wait for now.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.930
Aw, my phone battery's dead.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:22.400
I was hoping Ma-chan's voice 
would cheer me up a little bit...

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:25.400
What should we do about Onagawa?

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.740
Even if he's better in two weeks,

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:32.040
I don't think we'll have 
enough time to practice.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.870
What's there to think about?

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:38.300
We wouldn't be here without him.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:41.500
"Let's just form a team, then. An MRG club."

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:44.030
That was all him.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:49.420
Then Watari joined, 
Misato joined, Shotaro joined,

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:51.300
and we finally got our six.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.220
Come what may, Onagawa's one of us.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.600
The six of us are going to the Inter-High.

00:13:57.510 --> 00:13:59.590
We have the coach and the manager too,

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:00.930
so that makes eight.

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:01.790
Yeah.

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:11.030
Onagawa-senpai.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.490
Oh, e-er...

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.350
I-I'm back!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.350
Goodnight, then.

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.600
Night.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.580
Onagawa-senpai.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:36.250
Have you worked things out yet?

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:40.570
Not yet, I guess.

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:45.530
Are you concerned about 
your mistake at prefecturals?

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:49.070
That's part of it, I guess.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.660
Is it my fault?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:53.480
Huh?

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:57.120
Wh-Where'd that come from?

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:58.860
Because I...

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:05.740
Because I came to the dorm, 
and you're forced to have a roommate?

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:20.770
<i>That's</i> what you think?

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.570
Is that why you went along with my lie?

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:25.870
I see.

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.470
I didn't know you were such a Caring Ace.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:30.760
Don't call me that.

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:35.960
I've known Tsukidate 
and Shichigahama since we were kids.

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:40.300
Shichigahama was always coming up with ideas,

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:43.190
and Tsukidate would figure out
 how to make them happen.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:46.750
I was just along for the ride. 
Same with the rhythmic gymnastics stuff.

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:51.580
But forming the team was your idea.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:54.960
That was just me running my mouth.

00:15:56.250 --> 00:16:00.410
It was Shichigahama who suggested doing 
rhythmic gymnastics in high school.

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:03.110
And once we had a team, Tsukidate handled

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:06.100
all the busywork with the 
administration and student council.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:10.440
As I contemplated what I could contribute,

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:12.840
I decided I'd be the ace.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:18.080
We'd go to the Inter-High together, 
and I'd shine as the star of the team.

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:23.210
When you joined, I was determined 
to outshine you, too.

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:28.330
But I can't beat a Super Ace like you.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.060
Don't call me that.

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:33.780
But you <i>are</i> the ace, man.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.670
Don't you realize it?

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:38.230
The power you emit when you're performing...

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:43.990
You're the perfect ace. 
The kind I wanted to be.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.780
So you're giving up?

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:53.170
On becoming the ace and
 doing rhythmic gymnastics entirely?

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:57.440
I never wanted to be the ace.

00:16:57.440 --> 00:17:00.740
I just wanted to be good. 
At least as good as anyone around me.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:08.750
Misato Ryoya

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:08.750
Practice Notes

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:04.930
But even if I can't be the ace,
even if I can't be number one,

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:08.350
even if I'm told I have no talent...
I won't ever quit.

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:12.600
Because that's not what I'm doing this for.

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.570
Then why <i>are</i> you doing it?

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.810
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics Special!!
"The Undisputed King" Hakumei University

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.810
Shusaku Shida

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.880
Because I decided I also wanted to soar...

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:42.660
Well enough that someone watching me 
might think, "I want to soar, too."

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.870
I wanted to be capable of that.

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:47.330
That's all.

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:58.320
What exactly does 
"the perfect ace" mean to you?

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.300
The kind you wanted to be.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:06.430
I love your tumbling, Onagawa-senpai.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.200
But only your tumbling.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.270
Hey...

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:23.910
The kind of ace I want to be...

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:27.650
<i>She might rank second 
or third in overall popularity.</i>

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:31.030
<i>But she's always optimistic, 
aiming to do better.</i>

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:34.190
<i>Just watching her energizes me!</i>

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:36.090
<i>Mad respect, girl!</i>

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:44.950
Bro... So glad you're alive...

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:46.160
If we can't perform as six...

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:48.780
No, we just have to!

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:52.410
I need to tell Onagawa-senpai tomorrow!

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:05.390
Futaba?

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:07.120
Hey, Shotaro.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.800
Wanna come with?

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.630
Tan-Tan Days

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:20.940
S-Senpai, what about your foot?

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:24.860
Senpai?

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.280
Um, your foot...

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.400
{*}

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.680
O-Onagawa...

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.530
You... Your foot...

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:52.960
I thought you needed two or three weeks.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.320
Idol power is the best medicine!

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:56.210
Huh?!

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:58.260
Bro!

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:00.660
I'm so glad, Bro!

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:02.970
Watari, you're so annoying!

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:08.510
Thanks for everything, you two...

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.930
Ninja Ace, Spy Leaf.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:12.550
S-Sure?

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:14.690
Don't call me that.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.960
You're our ace. Admit it.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:20.730
I'm conceding regionals to you.

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:24.570
Not even I can beat you in three weeks.

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:28.030
But four weeks? Now that's another story.

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.170
I'll be the ace at the Inter-High.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:34.370
And I'll keep aiming higher, like Ma-chan!

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.760
That's the perfect ace in my mind!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:38.270
Ma-chan?

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:40.590
Onagawa-kun.

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:43.640
It looks like your foot is all better.

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:44.380
Yes!

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:46.470
Everything else is, too!

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:49.500
"Everything else"?

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:54.640
For the new choreography,

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:57.920
I want to change part of the lift.

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:00.150
Awesome!

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.400
Let's have a look.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:03.940
Futaba-kun, Misato-kun.

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:04.760
Yes?

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:09.060
This will require you to try 
a higher difficulty move.

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:10.030
Can you do it?

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:12.340
Yes!

00:21:12.340 --> 00:21:14.420
Let's give it our best, Misato-kun!

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:24.390
Misato-kun?
